extends ../../base-email

block content
  tr
    td(style="padding: 40px 40px 32px;")
      // Heading
      h1(style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 32px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") We've updated our Terms and Conditions
      
      // Greeting
      p(style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Hi 
        if name
          span(style="font-weight: 500;")= name
        else
          | there
        | ,
      
      // Main message
      p(style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | We wanted to let you know that we've updated our Terms and Conditions. These updates reflect changes to our services and improve clarity around how we operate.
      
      p(style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | The updated Terms and Conditions will go into effect on 
        if effectiveDate
          span(style="font-weight: 500; color: #202124;")= effectiveDate
        else
          span(style="font-weight: 500; color: #202124;") January 1, 2025
        | . By continuing to use Pacepard after this date, you agree to the updated terms.
      
      // Key Changes Section
      if keyChanges && keyChanges.length > 0
        p(style="margin: 24px 0 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Key changes:
        
        table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px;")
          each change in keyChanges
            tr
              td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
                | &bull; #{change}
      else
        p(style="margin: 24px 0 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Key changes:
        
        table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px;")
          tr
            td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
              | &bull; Clarified data usage and privacy practices
          tr
            td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
              | &bull; Updated service description and features
          tr
            td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
              | &bull; Enhanced user rights and responsibilities
      
      // CTA Button
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 24px 0;")
        tr
          td
            a(href=termsLink || "#" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 24px; background-color: #1A73E8; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Review the updated Terms
      
      // Additional info
      p(style="margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | If you have any questions about these changes, please 
        a(href="#" style="color: #1A73E8; text-decoration: none;") contact our support team
        | .
      
      // Closing
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Thanks,
        br
        span(style="font-weight: 500;") The Pacepard Team
